# ${SRC_DIR}/config/

Boot-time configuration for ${PROJECT_NAME} (frontend).

## What lives here

- [`env.ts`](env.ts) — zod-validated `import.meta.env` loader. Fails fast on boot if a required var is missing.
- [`queryClient.ts`](queryClient.ts) — React Query client singleton.
- [`theme.ts`](theme.ts) — minimal design tokens. Replace with your UI library's theme.

## What does NOT live here

- React components — those live in `${SRC_DIR}/components/` (shared) or inside a feature's `components/` folder.
- Business logic. Use `${SRC_DIR}/features/<name>/services/` or `${SRC_DIR}/lib/`.

## Naming

- Lowercase, one concern per file (`env.ts`, `queryClient.ts`, `theme.ts`).
- Each file is named after the resource it configures.

